1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,223
How do you know your software
partner is slipping?

2
00:00:02,392 --> 00:00:03,989
It’s rarely one big thing.

3
00:00:04,267 --> 00:00:07,088
The calls keep happening, but
there’s nothing new to see.

4
00:00:07,108 --> 00:00:09,147
A new name turns up on your project.

5
00:00:09,167 --> 00:00:11,125
Bugs you already reported come back.

6
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:12,911
One of these is a bad week.

7
00:00:12,931 --> 00:00:14,095
Three is a pattern.

